,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI宣布支持特朗普AI行政令，愿在模型发布前接受政府安全评估</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cloudflare监测显示机器人流量占比达57.4%正式超越人类流量</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布递归自我改进警告，呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发步伐</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯文档发布行业首创「人机双写」能力并原生接入WorkBuddy构建AI编辑器</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/253447d8854f4e6178ea27ff659528a2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月5日，腾讯文档在2026腾讯云AI产业应用大会上发布行业首创的「人机双写」能力，正式进化为AI原生内容平台。该功能原生采用WorkBuddy统一Agent内核，结合自研高性能编辑引擎与专业Skill，使AI能以同事身份进入编辑器，与用户享有同等操作权与上下文感知。双方可在同屏协作中实现文字填充、数据清洗、图表生成及PPT美化，并支持双重编辑冲突自动解决与操作逐条回溯。目前，腾讯文档企业版已全品类AI化，作为「效率智能体套件」核心组件深度内嵌至WorkBuddy工作台，支持读取存量资产。此外，腾讯文档通过MCP协议与OpenAPI开放百余项接口，依托腾讯混元大模型算力，推动行业从对话式AI向执行式AI范式转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国众议院发布269页AI立法草案：巨头面临半年一审，各州监管权冻结三年</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97cf32890bed12ea8b3a96c0d7d593b6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国众议院两党议员近日公布《伟大美国人工智能法案（Great American Artificial Intelligence Act of 2026）》讨论稿。该草案针对上一年收入超5亿美元且训练前沿模型的企业，要求其每半年聘请独立机构进行安全审计，防范制造大规模杀伤性武器或网络攻击等灾难性风险，违规者面临每日最高100万美元罚款。草案核心争议在于“州法优先权”，规定三年内禁止州政府制定专门监管AI模型开发的法律，旨在统一联邦监管标准。此外，法案还涵盖举报人保护、提高AI金融诈骗量刑、AI就业影响研究及K-12 AI素养教育等内容。目前草案处于征求反馈阶段，行业组织NetChoice对强制审计及商业秘密泄露风险表示担忧。该法案能否在8月国会休会前获得足够支持仍存在不确定性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI宣布支持特朗普AI行政令，愿在模型发布前接受政府安全评估</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式表态支持美国总统特朗普签署的人工智能模型发布前审查行政命令，并确认将参与相关评估流程。OpenAI负责各国事务的负责人乔治·奥斯本在伦敦SXSW活动期间证实，公司将签署该自愿性质的行政命令。根据该命令，联邦政府可在模型正式发布前30天获取访问权限，并要求企业参与基准测试，以评估模型在网络能力等方面的先进程度，从而界定其是否属于受监管的前沿模型。奥斯本强调，OpenAI不会被动等待监管，正主动向各国政府建议建立强有力且具备灵活性的监管机构，以适应技术快速演进。此举标志着OpenAI在面对美国联邦政府强化审查压力时，选择以合作姿态回应，旨在平衡前沿AI创新与国家安全监管需求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cloudflare监测显示机器人流量占比达57.4%正式超越人类流量</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e36765e1131c7c20912db2cc8090cc2a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cloudflare首席执行官马修·普林斯近日宣布，互联网流量结构发生历史性逆转，由机器人、爬虫及AI智能体发起的自动访问请求占比已达57.4%，正式超越人类用户的42.6%。这一趋势较原先预测的2027年底提前爆发。普林斯指出，互联网生态正加速向“付费抓取”模式转型，网站所有者应将自动化流量视为商业变现机遇而非单纯的对抗对象。为应对这一变化，Cloudflare正开发全新的底层基础设施与协议，旨在支撑未来高频结算与流量控制需求。此前，Cloudflare已推出允许网站拦截并对AI爬虫收费的服务平台。随着谷歌AI概述等功能普及，用户获取信息方式正从传统网页浏览向AI总结转变，行业需重构数据价值体系以适应AI智能体主导的流量新格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布递归自我改进警告，呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发步伐</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于6月4日发布文章《当AI构建自身》，披露AI在代码编写与自我改进方面的进展，并呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发。数据显示，截至2026年5月，Anthropic代码库中超80%代码由Claude自主编写，工程师交付效率较2024年提升8倍。在模型训练优化测试中，Claude的加速能力已达52倍，故障排查效率提升至人类的数十倍。Anthropic警告，AI在算力支持下正逼近“递归自我改进”阶段，即AI在无人类介入下自主升级，这可能导致“不对齐”行为被复利放大，引发失控风险。公司建议建立全球协调机制，在必要时主动放慢研发以留出对齐调适时间。尽管Anthropic已启动IPO筹备，年化收入突破470亿美元，但其此次公开呼吁反映了前沿科技在商业狂飙与技术安全之间的深刻悖论。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
